式感，將白飯倒入剩下的膠質湯底中，拌勻成一份吸飽鮮味的「雞湯雜炊」。這最後一擊，將雞白湯的層次發揮得淋漓盡致，每一口米飯都包裹著濃郁的膠原蛋白，是整餐最完美的收尾。\n總結評價\n這是一碗在風味與飽足感之間取得完美平衡的拉麵。從一開始的麵條彈性，到中段的多變配料，最後以湯飯收官，整套流程毫無冷場。對於追求高濃度味覺體驗的老饕來說，這碗麵展現了極高的完成度。",null,[0,107]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,31790,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prd2FVcDNWR3hYVVdGbVNTMUROa1Z5UjNsbU5YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa48a8b8ecd48af6f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjkwaUp3VGxXUWFmSS1DNkVyR3lmNXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prd2FVcDNWR3hYVVdGbVNTMUROa1Z5UjNsbU5YYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prd2FVcDNWR3hYVVdGbVNTMUROa1Z5UjNsbU5YYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prd2FVcDNWR3hYVVdGbVNTMUROa1Z5UjNsbU5YYxILMGRlZmtDb0IyNUwaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qa3dhVXAzVkd4WFVXRm1TUzFETmtWeV